            <div type="edition" xml:id="div2LIT7701PPDrowningWedn">
                <div type="textpart" xml:lang="gez" subtype="incipit">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLeu8">Oxford, Bodleian Library, Bodleian Ullendorff 8</ref>.</note>
                    <ab>
                        በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ አምላክ፡ ጸሎተ፡ መሥጥም፡ ዘዕለተ፡ <sic>ሩ</sic>ቡዕ፡ ዓቃቢሃ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ሩፋኤል፡
                        ወኮከባኒ፡ አጣርጅ፡ ጨትኩታኤል፡ ጨትኩታኤል፡ ቆትኤል፡ ቆትኤል፨
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" xml:lang="gez" subtype="explicit">
                    <note>The following explicit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLeu8">Oxford, Bodleian Library, Bodleian Ullendorff 8</ref>.</note>
                    <ab>
                        ፃዕ፡ መንፈስ፡ ርኩስ፡ በስሙ፡ ለኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ በዝቃለ፡ መለኮትከ፡ 
                        ዕቀባ፡ ወአድኅ<sic>ኖ</sic>፡ ወአቁም፡ ፍሬ፡ ውስተ፡ ማኅፀና፡ ለዓመትከ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን። ።
                    </ab>
                </div>
            </div>
